{"ts": "2026-05-26T05:23:42.509Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Hei, olen Hieronta Maatti. Millä nimellä kutsumme teidät hierontaan?", "call_sid": "CAdd8993c0bc5a4bac23f77046272ae18f", "stream_sid": "MZ51178331bd35a5891ef76fa5c783263b", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-26T05:24:01.290Z", "source": "user", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Nimeni on testihenkilö ja edustan organisaatiota testi OY.", "call_sid": "CAdd8993c0bc5a4bac23f77046272ae18f", "stream_sid": "MZ51178331bd35a5891ef76fa5c783263b", "speaking": false, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-26T05:24:02.576Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Kiitos. Kirjaan tietoja.", "call_sid": "CAdd8993c0bc5a4bac23f77046272ae18f", "stream_sid": "MZ51178331bd35a5891ef76fa5c783263b", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-26T05:24:06.609Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Mikä on teille mukava muisto näiltä tai aiemmilta ATK-päiviltä?", "call_sid": "CAdd8993c0bc5a4bac23f77046272ae18f", "stream_sid": "MZ51178331bd35a5891ef76fa5c783263b", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-26T05:24:21.583Z", "source": "user", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Muistan kun ensimmäinen tietokone tuli toimistoon.", "call_sid": "CAdd8993c0bc5a4bac23f77046272ae18f", "stream_sid": "MZ51178331bd35a5891ef76fa5c783263b", "speaking": false, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-26T05:24:22.856Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Kiitos. Kirjaan tietoja.", "call_sid": "CAdd8993c0bc5a4bac23f77046272ae18f", "stream_sid": "MZ51178331bd35a5891ef76fa5c783263b", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-26T05:24:26.425Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Eli kutsumme teidät nimellä testihenkilö, organisaatiosta testi OY, ja muistonne ATK-päiviltä on: \"Muistan kun ensimmäinen tietokone tuli toimistoon.\" Onko tämä oikein?", "call_sid": "CAdd8993c0bc5a4bac23f77046272ae18f", "stream_sid": "MZ51178331bd35a5891ef76fa5c783263b", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-26T05:24:54.866Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "En valitettavasti kuule sinua.", "call_sid": "CAdd8993c0bc5a4bac23f77046272ae18f", "stream_sid": "MZ51178331bd35a5891ef76fa5c783263b", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-26T05:25:41.107Z", "source": "user", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Kyllä yhteenveto on oikein.", "call_sid": "CAdd8993c0bc5a4bac23f77046272ae18f", "stream_sid": "MZ51178331bd35a5891ef76fa5c783263b", "speaking": false, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-26T05:25:42.389Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Kiitos. Kirjaan tietoja.", "call_sid": "CAdd8993c0bc5a4bac23f77046272ae18f", "stream_sid": "MZ51178331bd35a5891ef76fa5c783263b", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-26T05:25:44.891Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Kiitoksia. Kutsumme teidät mahdollisimman pian. Kuulemiin.", "call_sid": "CAdd8993c0bc5a4bac23f77046272ae18f", "stream_sid": "MZ51178331bd35a5891ef76fa5c783263b", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
